---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/mruv-laboratory.css';
import '../../styles/mruv-simulator.css';
---

<MainLayout title="MRUV Laboratory — PHYLO">
	<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
		<ol>
			<li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
			<li><a href="/laboratories">Laboratories</a></li>
			<li aria-current="page">MRUV</li>
		</ol>
	</nav>

	<header class="mruv-page-header">
		<p class="mruv-page-header__eyebrow">Uniformly Accelerated Motion</p>
		<h1>MRUV Laboratory</h1>
		<p class="mruv-page-header__description">
			Use guided motion experiments to collect measurements and relate experimental evidence to
			position, time, velocity, and acceleration.
		</p>
		<p class="mruv-status">Available</p>
	</header>

	<div
		class="mruv-main-image-placeholder"
		role="img"
		aria-label="Placeholder for the MRUV Laboratory main image"
	>
		MRUV Laboratory main image placeholder
	</div>

	<section class="mruv-section mruv-section--overview" aria-labelledby="about-laboratory-title">
		<div>
			<h2 id="about-laboratory-title">What is this laboratory?</h2>
			<p>
				Students carry out repeatable motion trials, collect timing data from the laboratory
				setup, and compare the results with the changing motion they observe. The experience
				connects physical experimentation with evidence-based analysis.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div>
			<h2>What will students learn?</h2>
			<ul class="mruv-concepts-list">
				<li>Position</li>
				<li>Time</li>
				<li>Velocity</li>
				<li>Acceleration</li>
				<li>Experimental data analysis</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mruv-section" aria-labelledby="needs-title">
		<h2 id="needs-title">What do you need?</h2>
		<ul class="mruv-components-list">
			<li>MRUV experimental setup</li>
			<li>Arduino board</li>
			<li>Two sensors</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="mruv-section" aria-labelledby="resources-title">
		<h2 id="resources-title">Resources</h2>
		<div class="mruv-resources-grid">
			<article class="mruv-resource">
				<h3>Documentation</h3>
				<p>Not available yet.</p>
			</article>
			<article class="mruv-resource">
				<h3>Software</h3>
				<p><a href="#simulador">Open the MRUV simulator</a> on this page.</p>
			</article>
			<article class="mruv-resource">
				<h3>GitHub</h3>
				<p>Repository link not available yet.</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mruv-section mruv-simulator" id="simulador" lang="es" aria-labelledby="simulator-title">
		<h2 id="simulator-title">Simulador MRUV</h2>
		<p>
			El carrito avanza sobre el riel con movimiento rectilíneo uniformemente acelerado.
			En cada cuadro del visor, la posición a lo largo del riel se calcula con
			x = x₀ + v₀t + ½at².
		</p>

		<div class="mruv-simulator__layout">
			<div class="mruv-simulator__viewport" id="mruv-viewport">
				<canvas
					id="mruv-canvas"
					aria-label="Vista 3D del riel y el carrito. El carrito se mueve a lo largo del riel."
				></canvas>
				<p id="mruv-status" class="mruv-simulator__status" role="status">Cargando el modelo del riel…</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mruv-simulator__panel">
				<p class="mruv-simulator__equation" id="mruv-equation">x = 0.00 + 0.08 t + ½ (0.10) t²</p>
				<div class="mruv-simulator__buttons">
					<button type="button" id="mruv-play">Reproducir</button>
					<button type="button" id="mruv-pause" disabled>Pausar</button>
					<button type="button" id="mruv-reset">Reiniciar</button>
				</div>

				<label class="mruv-simulator__field" for="mruv-v0">
					<span>Velocidad inicial v₀</span>
					<span class="mruv-simulator__field-value"><span id="mruv-v0-value">0.08</span> m/s</span>
					<input id="mruv-v0" type="range" min="-0.5" max="1.5" step="0.01" value="0.08" />
				</label>

				<label class="mruv-simulator__field" for="mruv-a">
					<span>Aceleración a</span>
					<span class="mruv-simulator__field-value"><span id="mruv-a-value">0.10</span> m/s²</span>
					<input id="mruv-a" type="range" min="-1.5" max="1.5" step="0.01" value="0.1" />
				</label>

				<p class="mruv-simulator__hint">Los cambios de v₀ y a se aplican al reiniciar.</p>

				<dl class="mruv-simulator__facts">
					<div>
						<dt>Posición inicial x₀</dt>
						<dd id="mruv-x0">0.00 m</dd>
					</div>
					<div>
						<dt>Longitud útil del riel</dt>
						<dd id="mruv-rail">—</dd>
					</div>
				</dl>

				<dl class="mruv-simulator__readout">
					<div>
						<dt>Tiempo</dt>
						<dd id="mruv-time">0.00 s</dd>
					</div>
					<div>
						<dt>Posición x</dt>
						<dd id="mruv-x">0.00 m</dd>
					</div>
					<div>
						<dt>Velocidad v</dt>
						<dd id="mruv-v">0.00 m/s</dd>
					</div>
				</dl>

				<p class="mruv-simulator__hint">Arrastra para girar la vista. La rueda acerca o aleja.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script>
		import { mountMruvSimulator } from '../../scripts/mruv-simulator.js';

		mountMruvSimulator(document.querySelector('#simulador'));
	</script>

	<section class="mruv-section" aria-labelledby="gallery-title">
		<h2 id="gallery-title">Laboratory Gallery</h2>
		<div class="mruv-gallery-grid">
			<div
				class="mruv-gallery-placeholder"
				role="img"
				aria-label="Placeholder for a future MRUV Laboratory photograph"
			>
				Future laboratory photograph
			</div>
			<div
				class="mruv-gallery-placeholder"
				role="img"
				aria-label="Placeholder for a future MRUV experiment photograph"
			>
				Future experiment photograph
			</div>
			<div
				class="mruv-gallery-placeholder"
				role="img"
				aria-label="Placeholder for a future MRUV setup photograph"
			>
				Future setup photograph
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</MainLayout>
